(2) Mbere yo gutora, Perezida w’Inama
Njyanama y’Akarere atangaza umubare
w’Abajyanama bahari ashingiye ku
bashyize umukono ku rutonde
rw’abitabiriye inama cyangwa
hifashishijwe ikoranabuhanga.
(3) Gutora bikorwa hakoreshejwe –
(a) ubwumvikane busesuye;
(b) gushyira ukuboko hejuru;
(c) uburyo bw’ikoranabuhanga;
(d) gutora bandika mu ibanga;
(e) cyangwa guhamagara umuntu mu
izina.

(a) gukurikirana uko ibyemezo by’Inama
Njyanama y’Akarere byubahirizwa
mu birebana n’imari n’ubukungu;
(b) gukurikirana imishinga
y’amajyambere;
(c) gushyiraho ingamba zo kongera
umutungo;
(d) gukangurira abaturage ibikorwa
by’amajyambere;
(e) gukangurira abaturage gukorera mu
makoperative;
(f) gutegura imishinga y’amabwiriza
yigwa n’Inama Njyanama y’Akarere
mu bijyanye n’inshingano za
Komisiyo;
(g) gusuzuma ibindi yashingwa n’Inama
Njyanama y’Akarere bijyanye
n’inshingano zayo.

y’Akarere isuzuma ingingo afitemo
inyungu itaziguye cyangwa iziguye;
(b) kujya, ku buryo butaziguye cyangwa
buziguye, mu mirimo y’ubucuruzi
Akarere gafitemo uruhare;
(c) kwakira imisoro n’amahoro;
(d) no gukora imirimo y’ubucuruzi ku
giti cye.
